| HTML Tag|  Purpose                                             |
| <img>   | Webpage par image add karne ke liye use hota hai.    |
| <h1>    | Main Heading likhne ke liye use hota hai.            |
| <title> | Browser tab ka title set karta hai.                  |
| <body>  | Webpage ka main visible content rakhta hai.          |
| <p>     | Paragraph likhne ke liye use hota hai.               |
